{"data": [{"broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-15", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762387, "segment_id": "QefeP0w0g0", "segment_broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "segment_title": "Preview/Introduction Brian Williams (Athens); John Seigenthaler (Punta Gorda, Florida)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 50, "segment_type_id": 1, "segment_start_time": "63000.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762387, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "Preview", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-15", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762387, "segment_id": "GffELJXQoX", "segment_broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "segment_title": "Hurricane Charley / Florida", "segment_description": "(Punta Gorda, Florida: John Seigenthaler)  The devastation in southwest Florida introduced; scenes shown of damaged buildings in Punta Gorda; storm damage statistics cited. \n (Punta Gorda: Martin Savidge)  The Sunday after the hurricane struck Florida featured; scenes shown of wrecked boats, mobile homes, homes, citrus groves, people, the cleanup of debris.  [Two RESIDENTS&nbsp- react.]  [President BUSH&nbsp- comments on the devastation & a quick response.] \n (Punta Gorda, Florida: John Seigenthaler)  Report introduced. \n (Arcadia, Florida: Jim Cummins)  The destruction in the small town of Arcadia featured; scenes shown of the wreckage; details recalled of the revival of Main Street in the last five years.  [Residents Denny & Cindy DIGMAN&#135;, Toni BENEVIDIG&#135;, Lee MERLE&#135;- describe what happened.] \n (Punta Gorda, Florida: John Seigenthaler)  The impact of the hurricane on the barrier islands of Captiva & Sanibel featured; scenes shown of damaged homes, the split of Upper Captiva, torn roofs, downed trees. \n (Punta Gorda, Florida: Don Teague)  The bond between people & their pets during the storm featured; scenes shown from Punta Gorda.  [Residents Carol BARTLETT, Melissa HEPLER, Lauren TOLLEY&nbsp- explain why they stayed home with their animals.] \n (Punta Gorda, Florida: John Seigenthaler)  New Tropical Storm Earl mentioned.", "segment_duration": 600, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63050.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762388, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-15", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 762387, "segment_id": "nyBSLW98O7", "segment_broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "segment_title": "Upcoming Items (Athens: Brian Williams)", "segment_description": "null", "segment_duration": 20, "segment_type_id": 2, "segment_start_time": "63650.0", "legacy_segment_id": 762389, "network_name": "NBC", "broadcast_type_name": "Evening News", "segment_type_name": "News", "segment_contributors_with_roles": null, "broadcast_contributors_with_roles": null, "topic_names": null, "location_names": null}, {"broadcast_id": "6S4MFyRDCe", "broadcast_date": "2004-08-15", "broadcast_start_time": "63000.0", "network": 3, "distributor": 10, "broadcast_title": "NBC Nightly News", "broadcast_type_id": 1, "broadcast_duration": 1710, "broadcast_description": null, "legacy_broadcast_id": 7623